v3.0.9

Fixed InstallShield CAB detection using the native ISc( signature, while preserving legacy data*.cab + .hdr multi-volume handling.
Renamed arc_conv.exe → arc_convert.exe throughout plugin handling.
Improved CreateInstall Extractor plugin installation:- supports current cif-setup.zip package layout,
- extracts nested setup packages without executing them,
- supports manual selection of ci-extractor.exe, gea.dll, and gentee.dll,
- validates required runtime files and reports missing components.